  "solution": {
    "text": "Total number of ways $={ }^3 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\times{ }^9 \\mathrm{C}_2$\n$$\n=3 \\times \\frac{9 \\times 8}{2}=3 \\times 36=108\n$$",
